stateDiagram-v2
    state Incident {
      [*] --> Active: Eligible local spawn or valid owner delivery
      Active --> Active: Active-world tick / type-specific effects and spread
      Active --> Frozen: Leave owner world or close game
      Frozen --> Active: Restore remaining duration without offline catch-up
      Active --> Ended: Expiry or applicable resolution
      Ended --> [*]
    }
    state BiomeDamage {
      [*] --> Intact
      Intact --> Burned: ForestFire effect / rescue creatures before suppression
      Burned --> Burned: Incident timer ends / damage remains
      Burned --> Intact: Applicable Rain recovery
    }
    note right of Incident
      Non-destructive types do not cause Burned.
      Enum support does not imply all types are enabled.
    end note
